  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Organisation of Supreme Audit Institutions (INTOSAI) operates as an umbrella organisation for the external government audit community. The contr. supports the training arm of the organisation, INTOSAI Development Initiative (IDI) which has been a cooperative partner of Sida since 2002. The Secretariat is situated in Norway. Training and capacity development of audit instititions.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The International Organisation of Supreme Audit Institutions (INTOSAI) &#xe4;r en paraplyorganisation for riksrevisioner. Sida st&#xf6;djer en del av INTOSAI, INTOSAI Development Initiative (IDI) som genom tr&#xe4;ningsprogram st&#xe4;rker utvecklingsl&#xe4;nders SAI-kapacitet. Sida st&#xf6;d sedan 2002. Sekretariatet &#xe4;r placerat i Oslo. Sida har 2009 signerat en MoU mellan givare &amp; INTOSAI. RiR &#xe4;r ledande i arbetet.</narrative>
  </description>
